REQP-1852#1 Warning
BUFGCE_cascade_from_clock_buf  
Cascaded clock buffers exist in the design with constant CE pin. This may result in large clock skew and timing violations. Cell BUFGCE top_block_i/clock_wrapper/clk_wiz_1/inst/clkin1_bufg I pin is driven by another clock buffer top_block_i/clock_wrapper/clk_wiz_0/inst/clkout1_buf.
